{% extends "_base.j2" %}
{% block body %}
Write the **{{ section.name }}** section of an academic paper.

Topic: {{ topic }}
Venue style: {{ format_spec.venue_label }} ({{ format_spec.display_name }})
Language: {{ format_spec.language }}
Citation style: {{ format_spec.citation_style }} — when you cite, use placeholders
of the form `[CITE:<short-key>]`; the citation stage will replace them with
real BibTeX keys.

Section bullets to cover:
{% for b in section.bullets %}
- {{ b }}
{% endfor %}

Constraints:
- ~{{ words_target }} words.
- No section heading (the renderer adds it).
- No fabricated numbers or citations: use `[CITE:<key>]` placeholders only.
- Plain text paragraphs separated by blank lines. No Markdown.
{% endblock %}
